    <div class="card">
      <p class="mt0">A good deal of day-to-day village chatter happens in The Lenches Community, a private Facebook group run by local volunteers: lost cats, road closures, recommendations and things for sale. You'll need to ask to join.</p>
      <p>With the admins' blessing, we pick up events and notices from the group for this site and the Thursday newsletter, credited to the group.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/thelenchescommunity/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find the group on Facebook</a></p>
